    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "GIN VACUUM 可能把内部页当叶子页，造成索引损坏",
      "summary": "Peter Geoghegan 报告了一个影响所有稳定分支的 GIN 索引损坏：ginVacuumPostingTreeLeaves() 把共享锁升级为排他锁后没有重新检查页面是否仍是叶子页，VACUUM 可能把内部页当叶子页处理，漏掉该清除的死 TID。Andrey Borodin 确认这是真实的数据损坏，追溯到 fd83c83d0。另一个缺陷是 ginInsertCleanup 只在 ginbulkdelete 的第一遍被调用。",
      "url": "https://www.postgresql.org/message-id/CAH2-Wz=RBpJTQgvOxr6C=J04dExmFSt1E3F-r+cRTQ56hEotkg@mail.gmail.com",
      "author": "Peter Geoghegan",
      "source": "PostgreSQL hackers",
      "source_date": "2026-08-15",
      "image": "",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "GIN",
        "VACUUM",
        "数据损坏"
      ],
      "position": 1
    },
    {
      "tier": 1,
      "title": "并发分离分区未完成会引发崩溃，补丁将回移",
      "summary": "DETACH PARTITION ... CONCURRENTLY 的等待阶段一旦被中断，分区的 in-detach 标记只有 FINALIZE 能清除，于是 relispartition 仍为真，而 get_partition_ancestors() 返回空列表。Mihail Nikalayeu 压测时发现三处代码都假设祖先列表非空，会触发断言失败或空指针解引用。Álvaro Herrera 计划下周推入并回移。",
      "url": "https://www.postgresql.org/message-id/CADzfLwWoFPT+a73=A=bsNWRMZQ98NpBEMgE=t1FS4O4_=QVLfA@mail.gmail.com",
      "author": "Mihail Nikalayeu",
      "source": "PostgreSQL hackers",
      "source_date": "2026-08-15",
      "image": "",
      "domain": "pg",
      "tags": [
        "分区",
        "崩溃"
      ],
      "position": 2
